{"version":1,"youtubeId":"yyyJ9gnldD8","start":1065,"end":1095,"segments":[{"start":1065,"end":1095,"mode":"F","confidence":0,"focus":{"x":0.5,"y":0.45}}],"sentences":[{"text":"Why? Because he knows that Allah Subhana wa Ta'ala will provide an ifar.","s":1065.12,"e":1070.08,"next":1070.08,"key":"Because","words":[{"w":"Why?","t":1065.12},{"w":"Because","t":1065.6},{"w":"he","t":1065.92},{"w":"knows","t":1066.24},{"w":"that","t":1066.4},{"w":"Allah","t":1066.64},{"w":"Subhana","t":1066.96},{"w":"wa","t":1067.2},{"w":"Ta'ala","t":1067.35},{"w":"will","t":1067.76},{"w":"provide","t":1068.16},{"w":"an","t":1068.64},{"w":"ifar.","t":1068.8}]},{"text":"He knows that.","s":1070.08,"e":1071.96,"next":1072.48,"key":"knows","words":[{"w":"He","t":1070.08},{"w":"knows","t":1070.32},{"w":"that.","t":1070.56}]},{"text":"So he's intending this, knowing I will have Anar and Ifar will be brought.","s":1072.48,"e":1078.4,"next":1078.4,"key":"intending","words":[{"w":"So","t":1072.48},{"w":"he's","t":1072.64},{"w":"intending","t":1072.88},{"w":"this,","t":1073.36},{"w":"knowing","t":1074.08},{"w":"I","t":1075.04},{"w":"will","t":1075.28},{"w":"have","t":1075.52},{"w":"Anar","t":1075.68},{"w":"and","t":1076.32},{"w":"Ifar","t":1076.47},{"w":"will","t":1076.8},{"w":"be","t":1077.04},{"w":"brought.","t":1077.2}]},{"text":"And I've done this myself.","s":1078.4,"e":1080.4,"next":1080.4,"key":"myself","words":[{"w":"And","t":1078.4},{"w":"I've","t":1078.64},{"w":"done","t":1078.88},{"w":"this","t":1079.04},{"w":"myself.","t":1079.28}]},{"text":"Where when I was, when I was in university, I had made the intention.","s":1080.4,"e":1085.6,"next":1085.6,"key":"university","words":[{"w":"Where","t":1080.4},{"w":"when","t":1081.76},{"w":"I","t":1082},{"w":"was,","t":1082.16},{"w":"when","t":1082.32},{"w":"I","t":1082.56},{"w":"was","t":1082.72},{"w":"in","t":1082.87},{"w":"university,","t":1083.04},{"w":"I","t":1084.24},{"w":"had","t":1084.48},{"w":"made","t":1084.64},{"w":"the","t":1084.88},{"